<title>USA: First Commonwealth Financial Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>First Commonwealth Financial Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANA, Pa. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>FIRST COMMONWEALTH FINANCIAL CORPORATION</p>
<p>				     Financial Highlights</p>
<p>						For Quarter Ended Sept 30</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p>    Net Income ($000)			$5,862	    $7,455</p>
<p>    Earnings Per Share			$0.27	     $0.34</p>
<p>    Return on Average Assets		0.93%	     1.28%</p>
<p>    Return on Average Equity		9.05%	    12.02%</p>
<p>					   For 9 Mos Ended Sept 30</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p>    Net Income ($000)		     $19,863	   $19,740</p>
<p>    Earnings Per Share			$0.90	     $0.90</p>
<p>    Return on Average Assets		1.09%	     1.14%</p>
<p>    Return on Average Equity	     10.34%	    11.07%</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
